{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026aZX7KScwmY1795531489.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>伊利沙伯醫院內科病房，出現甲型流感病毒群組。</p><p></p><p>院方稱，一個內科女病房上周五起，先後有4名介乎60至75歲病人出現發燒或呼吸道感染徵狀，均對甲型流感病毒呈陽性反應，現正接受隔離治療，其中一人因自身疾病而情況危殆，其餘3人情況穩定。</p><p></p><p>院方已加強感染控制措施，亦已將個案呈報醫管局及衞生防護中心跟進。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T16:03:52.982676+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T14:39:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T16:19:08.349297+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T15:57:15.883952+00:00","content_hash":"b36185fb109bf110b6f7f0c2c8317917e81ff44c73a8de5e1461dc3067d87714","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T16:03:52.982676+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}